                                                "sense_id": "f0cc9727-6d03-38f3-b447-3ad15e3caa9b",
                                                "text": "We turned to see a muscular young man lounging in the door which led into the sitting-room. He wore green corduroy trousers, a duffle coat and an old school tie."
